quiz 3 | "It is a truth universally acknowledged, that a single man in possession of a good fortune, must be in want of a wife." Which novel?
* Pride and Prejudice
o Emma
o Middlemarch
o Jane Eyre
= Austen, 1813. The irony: it's the families who want the rich man, not the reverse.
